---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { displayDate } from '../../lib/format';
const lang = 'en';
const UPDATED = '2026-10-05';
const gaCookie = `_ga_${GA4_ID.replace(/^G-/, '')}`;
---
<PageLayout title="Cookies and analytics: notary fees calculator in France" description="Cookies on the notary fees calculator in France: Microsoft Clarity and Google Analytics, how long each cookie lasts, masked prices and how to block them." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    <p>Notary fees, transfer tax and capital gains are calculated in your browser: the property price, département and options you choose are never written to a cookie. The cookies on this site are only used to measure its audience, with no consent banner. See also the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Status</th><th>Tool</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Strictly necessary</td><td>none</td><td>–</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Analytics / audience measurement</td><td><strong>active</strong></td><td>Microsoft Clarity, Google Analytics 4</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Advertising</td><td>none</td><td>–</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Social networks</td><td>none</td><td>–</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Microsoft Clarity</h2>
    <p>Loaded as soon as the page opens, Clarity shows us how the simulations and guides are used (clicks, scrolling, pages viewed) through session recordings and heatmaps. Prices, deposits and other values entered in the calculator are masked in your browser before anything is sent, and updates to the page address are not picked up by Clarity. Cookies: <code>_clck</code>, visitor identifier, one year; <code>_clsk</code>, groups the pages of a visit, one day. Microsoft may also set <code>MUID</code> and <code>CLID</code> on its own domains.</p>

    <h2>Google Analytics 4</h2>
    <p>Provided by Google Ireland Limited and loaded the same way, Google Analytics counts page views and reports where visits come from, how long they last, device type and approximate location. Cookies: <code>_ga</code>, two years; <code>{gaCookie}</code>, two years. Data is kept for 14 months.</p>

    <h2>Blocking these cookies</h2>
    <p>No banner is shown. To refuse audience measurement, block third-party cookies or the <code>clarity.ms</code> and <code>google-analytics.com</code> domains in your browser, or install the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>, then clear the site data. The calculator remains fully usable. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Last updated: {displayDate(UPDATED, 'en-GB')}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
